<title>FRANCE: CEA Industrie H1 pre-tax profit rises.</title>
<headline>CEA Industrie H1 pre-tax profit rises.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30, 1996</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Pre-tax attributable		   2,389.5  vs	 1,666.6</p>
<p>    Operating				  1,166    vs	 1,083</p>
<p>    Turnover				  25.4 bln, up 9.2 pct</p>
<p>NOTE - CEA Industrie said the results reflected an increase in SGS-Thomson Microelectronics NV results and the positive impact of the dollar.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
